    "_postman_id": "cifo-camera-api-2026-v1",
    "name": "CIFO Security — Camera API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap endpoint Camera API sistem CIFO Security.\n\n⚠️  CATATAN PENTING — Route Prefix:\nSemua routes di-mount di /api (lihat api/server.js baris 149: app.use('/api', router))\n• Sistem In-Memory: base_url + /api/cameras/*\n• Sistem Database:   base_url + /api/api/cameras/*  ← double prefix (bug di router.js)\n\n🐛 BUG AKTIF — Sistem Database (per 2026-05-04):\n1. GET /api/api/cameras → 500 'Camera.getCount is not a function'\n   Penyebab: CameraController.js:19 memanggil Camera.getCount() yang tidak ada di model\n   Status: Perlu fix backend — tambah method getCount() di models/Camera.js\n\n2. POST /api/api/cameras → 400 'Field name is required'\n   Penyebab: Controller validasi field name/ip_address/location tapi model pakai label/lat/lng/stream_url\n   Workaround: Kirim KEDUA set field sekaligus (lihat contoh di request POST)\n\n3. GET /api/api/cameras/C240-01 → 404 'Camera not found'\n   Penyebab: Akibat Bug 2, C240-01 tidak pernah berhasil di-INSERT ke database\n   Solusi: Gunakan workaround di Bug 2 untuk mendaftarkan kamera terlebih dahulu\n\nDibuat dari: docs/CAMERA_TESTING.md\nVersi: 1.2 — 2026-05-04 (fix prefix + dokumentasi bug aktif)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
