    {
      "name": "🗄️ Sistem Database (/api/api/cameras) ⚠️ double prefix",
      "description": "⚠️  URL aktual: base_url + /api/api/cameras/*\n\nIni karena router.js mendefinisikan route sebagai '/api/cameras/*' tapi router sudah di-mount di '/api' (server.js:149). Hasilnya double prefix /api/api/.\n\nIni adalah bug di api/router.js yang perlu diperbaiki backend.\nSambil menunggu fix, gunakan URL /api/api/cameras/* di bawah ini.\n\nStatus format: UPPERCASE — ONLINE / OFFLINE / MAINTENANCE / ERROR",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Semua Kamera (paginated) 🐛 BUG AKTIF",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/api/cameras?limit=10&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "api", "cameras"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "ONLINE", "disabled": true, "description": "Filter: ONLINE/OFFLINE/MAINTENANCE/ERROR" },
                { "key": "area", "value": "Bandung", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "🐛 BUG AKTIF: Request ini akan gagal dengan:\n{ \"success\": false, \"message\": \"Failed to retrieve cameras\", \"error\": \"Camera.getCount is not a function\" }\n\nPenyebab: CameraController.js baris 19 memanggil Camera.getCount() yang tidak ada di models/Camera.js\n\nFix yang diperlukan (oleh backend developer):\nTambahkan method getCount() di models/Camera.js:\n\nstatic async getCount(filters = {}) {\n  const connection = await this.getConnection();\n  try {\n    let query = 'SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cameras';\n    const params = [];\n    const conditions = [];\n    if (filters.status) { conditions.push('status = ?'); params.push(filters.status); }\n    if (filters.area) { conditions.push('area = ?'); params.push(filters.area); }\n    if (conditions.length > 0) query += ' WHERE ' + conditions.join(' AND ');\n    const [rows] = await connection.execute(query, params);\n    return rows[0].count;\n  } finally { await connection.end(); }\n}\n\nAlternatif sementara: Gunakan GET /api/api/cameras/stats untuk data ringkasan."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('success = true', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('Ada pagination', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('pagination'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
